   "source": [
    "# 豊岡市「コバス」を診断する：GTFS × GIS演習\n",
    "\n",
    "**参加者向け・約60分**\n",
    "\n",
    "難しい処理は「準備用セル」にしまってあります。皆さんが実行するコードは、基本的に1～2行です。\n",
    "\n",
    "この演習で考える問いは3つです。\n",
    "\n",
    "1. コバスは、いつ・どこを・何便運行しているか？\n",
    "2. 停留所300m圏に、人口と高齢者人口はどのくらいいるか？\n",
    "3. 近隣人口に対して、便数が相対的に少なく見える停留所はどこか？\n",
    "\n",
    "> 上から順に「▶」を押してください。変更するのは、後に出てくる分析日と距離だけです。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0a011ae9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. 準備\n",
    "\n",
    "次のセルは講師が設定済みのものを配布します。参加者は変更せずに実行してください。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "26f4c446",
   "metadata": {
    "cellView": "form"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# @title 講師用設定（参加者は変更しません）\n",
    GITHUB_REPOSITORY = "HajimeSeya/toyooka-gtfs-gis-workshop" # @param {type:\"string\"}
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "70b26f4c",
   "metadata": {
    "cellView": "form",
    "collapsed": true,
    "jupyter": {
     "source_hidden": true
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# @title 分析環境を準備（コードを見る必要はありません）\n",
    "import importlib.util\n",
    "import os\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "import shutil\n",
    "import subprocess\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "import requests\n",
    "\n",
    "required = {\n",
    "    \"geopandas\": \"geopandas>=1.0,<2\",\n",
    "    \"pyogrio\": \"pyogrio>=0.10,<1\",\n",
    "    \"folium\": \"folium>=0.17,<1\",\n",
    "    \"japanize_matplotlib\": \"japanize-matplotlib>=1.1,<2\",\n",
    "}\n",
    "missing = [package for module, package in required.items() if importlib.util.find_spec(module) is None]\n",
    "if missing:\n",
    "    subprocess.check_call([sys.executable, \"-m\", \"pip\", \"install\", \"-q\", *missing])\n",
    "\n",
    "if \"REPLACE_WITH\" in GITHUB_REPOSITORY:\n",
    "    raise ValueError(\"講師がGITHUB_REPOSITORYを設定してください。\")\n",
    "\n",
    "tools_file = Path(\"toyooka_workshop_tools.py\")\n",
    "test_dir = os.environ.get(\"WORKSHOP_TEST_DATA_DIR\")\n",
    "if test_dir and (Path(test_dir) / tools_file.name).exists():\n",
    "    shutil.copy2(Path(test_dir) / tools_file.name, tools_file)\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    tools_url = f\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/{GITHUB_REPOSITORY}/main/{tools_file.name}\"\n",
    "    response = requests.get(tools_url, timeout=180)\n",
    "    response.raise_for_status()\n",
    "    tools_file.write_bytes(response.content)\n",
    "\n",
    "from toyooka_workshop_tools import (\n",
    "    load_workshop, show_gtfs_tables, check_gtfs, show_population_summary,\n",
    "    select_service, show_route_summary, show_service_timeline, make_gtfs_map,\n",
    "    analyze_access, show_access_summary, show_access_chart, make_access_map,\n",
    "    show_service_calendar, save_results,\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "POPULATION_URL = (\n",
    "    f\"https://github.com/{GITHUB_REPOSITORY}/releases/download/workshop-2026/\"\n",
    "    \"toyooka_population_250m_r6_workshop.geojson.zip\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "GTFS_URL = (\n",
    "    \"https://api.gtfs-data.jp/v2/organizations/toyookacity/feeds/kobus/files/\"\n",
    "    \"feed.zip?uid=b08b66d5-af93-421f-b02c-6f02f4f41b5e\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "print(\"準備ができました。\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "5b7a2642",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "workshop = load_workshop(GTFS_URL, POPULATION_URL)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "901c7be4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. GTFSの表を見てみる\n",
    "\n",
    "GTFSは、路線・便・時刻・停留所などの複数の表をIDでつないだデータです。\n",
    "\n",
    "| 表 | 内容 | 接続に使うID |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| `routes` | 路線 | `route_id` |\n",
    "| `trips` | 1回ごとの運行便 | `route_id`, `trip_id` |\n",
    "| `stop_times` | 各便の停車時刻 | `trip_id`, `stop_id` |\n",
    "| `stops` | 停留所名・緯度経度 | `stop_id` |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "5b8066e7",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "show_gtfs_tables(workshop)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b2d4464c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 簡易点検\n",
    "\n",
    "TransitLensのFeed healthのように、必須ファイルやIDの対応を簡単に確認します。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "0c856b44",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "check_gtfs(workshop)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "75d88728",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. 分析する日を決める\n",
    "\n",
    "日付を変更すると、平日・土休日・祝日の違いを確認できます。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "04424f68",
   "metadata": {
    "cellView": "form"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "ANALYSIS_DATE = \"2026-10-14\" # @param {type:\"date\"}\n",
    "service = select_service(workshop, ANALYSIS_DATE)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "b5264f3e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "show_route_summary(service)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "093e2f70",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 何時ごろに運行しているか"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "7775ce2c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "show_service_timeline(service)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "35501f28",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 路線と停留所を地図で見る\n",
    "\n",
    "このGTFSには`shapes.txt`がないため、破線は停留所を順番に結んだ概略線です。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "fe0bad96",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "gtfs_map = make_gtfs_map(workshop, service)\n",
    "gtfs_map"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "266cb867",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. 人口データを確認する\n",
    "\n",
    "国土交通省の250mメッシュ別将来推計人口を使用します。2025年・2040年は推計値です。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "855f969c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "show_population_summary(workshop)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b4b28bf4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. 停留所の近くの人口を集計する\n",
    "\n",
    "最初は300mとします。ここは自由に変更できます。\n",
    "\n",
    "- 300m：停留所に比較的近い範囲\n",
    "- 500m：より広い徒歩圏を仮定した場合\n",
    "\n",
    "実際の道路距離ではなく、停留所からの直線距離であることに注意してください。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "03a51f7d",
   "metadata": {
    "cellView": "form"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "CATCHMENT_M = 300 # @param {type:\"slider\", min:100, max:1000, step:50}\n",
    "access = analyze_access(workshop, service, CATCHMENT_M)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "9536fdf8",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "show_access_summary(access)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e90f0c6a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "表の`人口／停車回数`が大きい停留所は、近隣人口に対してサービス供給が相対的に少ない可能性があります。ただし、増便の優先順位を直接決めるものではありません。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "4a0ee288",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "show_access_chart(access, service)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5c1b0ed3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. GTFS・人口・停留所圏域を重ねる"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "ef7abee7",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "final_map = make_access_map(workshop, service, access)\n",
    "final_map"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3f33c44a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. 実務者として考える\n",
    "\n",
    "1. 近隣人口に対して停車回数が少なく見える停留所はどこでしょうか？\n",
    "2. 高齢者人口のカバー率は、総人口のカバー率より高いでしょうか？\n",
    "3. 300m圏を500m圏に変えると、結果はどの程度変わりますか？\n",
    "4. 増便や経路変更を考える前に、どんなデータを追加すべきでしょうか？\n",
    "\n",
    "追加候補：乗降客数、便別乗客数、病院・商業施設、道路勾配、歩道、世帯の自動車保有、住民の移動ニーズ。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b63622a5",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 発展：年間の運行日を確認する"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "7d5220e9",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "show_service_calendar(workshop)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f980d584",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 8. 結果を保存する"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "8e4c2808",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "result_zip = save_results(workshop, service, access, final_map)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0c5d43be",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## この分析の限界\n",
    "\n",
    "- 250mメッシュ内で人口が一様に分布すると仮定して面積按分しています。\n",
    "- 停留所別の圏域は重なるため、停留所別人口を合計してはいけません。\n",
    "- GTFSは運行計画であり、実際の利用者数や遅延を表しません。\n",
    "- 実務判断では、現場知識・乗降実績・道路条件・施設立地などを加えます。\n",
    "\n",
    "**出典**\n",
    "\n",
    "- [GTFSデータリポジトリ：豊岡市コバス](https://gtfs-data.jp/search?pref=%E5%85%B5%E5%BA%AB%E7%9C%8C)\n",
    "- [国土交通省：250mメッシュ別将来推計人口データ（R6国政局推計）](https://nlftp.mlit.go.jp/ksj/gml/datalist/KsjTmplt-mesh250r6.html)（CC BY 4.0）"
   ]
  }
